*.zip

# ─── Figures ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every figure in this repo is regenerated by a tracked script: the 22 plot_*.py
# at the root produce sweep_figures/ and accuracy_plot_*, and
# convlstm_ano/convlstm_ano/make_pipeline_fig.py produces pipeline.*. The
# manuscript itself has no \includegraphics, so nothing here is needed to build
# fl_sec.tex. Untracked to keep the repo small; run the scripts to recreate.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.eps
*.svg
sweep_figures/
pipeline.pdf
pipeline.pre_redraw.pdf
